OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for Northern Olympics to get
OL,4,A#7m in Healey's Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last time the UK hosted the
OL,7,FOlympics was London 2012. A UK Trade
OL,8,Fand Investment (UKTI) department report
OL,9,Festimated in 2013 it boosted the
OL,10,Feconomy by #9.9bn, although the amount
OL,11,Fwas met with some scepticism.
